Modified by Chillimedia on 2026-10-19:
- Renamed plugin identity, main file, visible branding and documentation.
- Fixed endpoint to consent.chillimedia.se; legacy options/config cannot
  redirect activation, API or banner requests to Conzent Cloud.
- Added independent Update URI; Chillimedia distributes future updates.
- Safe remote API calls, disabled redirects for verification, explicit
  overview capability check and safe external-link attributes.
- Separate actual verification status from the legacy loader-enabled flag;
  retain manually entered keys with an explicit pending status when offline.
- Read asynchronous banner state at event time; exact cookie-name matching,
  safe cookie decoding and object-based consent category mapping.
- Removed upstream logo; standard WordPress dashboard icon used.

Function prefixes, option names, cron hooks, text domain and shortcodes
remain compatible with upstream. The two plugins must not be active together.
